<title>USA: Columbia, Ill. won by Boatmen's Bank.</title>
<headline>Columbia, Ill. won by Boatmen's Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boatmen's Bank said it won $1.520 million of Columbia, Ill., combined waterworks and sewerage system improvement alternate bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.82 percent.</p>
</text>
